 <div class="doc-subhead" id="iam">5. Identity and Access Management</div>
 <div class="doc-callout"><p>This is the section most likely to be misunderstood in an interview, so read it slowly. <strong>Do not say Microsoft Entra ID = AWS IAM.</strong> They are not peers. They solve different layers of the same overall problem.</p></div>
 <div class="doc-subhead">The Core Distinction: Directory vs. Authorization</div>
