 <div class="doc-subhead">"What is an AWS VPC?"</div>
 <p class="doc-para">Your own isolated virtual network inside AWS, where you define IP address ranges and place resources into subnets. <strong>OCI equivalent:</strong> a VCN. <strong>Difference:</strong> none significant at the core concept level. This is one of the safest translations in cloud computing.</p>
 <div class="doc-subhead">"What is S3?"</div>
